<p>Provided here is coding for use in the RealTest platform to implement th=
e indicator described in John Ehlers=E2=80=99 article in this issue, =E2=80=
=9CAdaptive SuperSmoother.=E2=80=9D</p>=20
<p>Figure 4 demonstrates both the SuperSmoother and adaptive SuperSmoother =
